#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:19
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "MT52 Hornet"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:20
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:93
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:214
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:330
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:347
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:368
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:390
msgctxt "class"
msgid "Starfighter"
msgstr "Raumjäger"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:20
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:330
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:347
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Interceptor"
msgstr "Abfangjäger"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:25
msgid ""
"The MT52 Hornet is a basic interceptor-class starfighter found in many "
"corners of the galaxy. It's easy to find spare parts for MT52s, not only "
"because they're produced in large numbers, but also because they suffer high "
"losses in combat."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:37
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "MU52 Hornet"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:41
msgid ""
"The MU52 Hornet is an upgraded version of the MT52 interceptor-class "
"starfighter. All of its systems are slightly improved over the MT52 model."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:52
msgctxt "playerShip"
msgid "MP52 Hornet"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:56
msgid ""
"The MP52 Hornet is a significantly upgraded version of MU52 Hornet "
"interceptor-class starfighter, with nearly twice the hull strength, nearly "
"three times the shielding, better acceleration, impulse boosters, and a "
"second laser cannon."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:92
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Adder MK5"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:93
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:368
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:390
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Gunship"
msgstr "Kanonenboot"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:98
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:120
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:138
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:154
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:169
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:184
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:200
msgid ""
"The Adder starfighter hull is a long-running, frequently iterated-upon "
"design. Adders are commonly classified as gunships, with most models "
"featuring several beam weapons and at least one weapon tube."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:100
msgid ""
"The Adder MK5 has proven to be a great success amongst pirates and system "
"patrols alike. It's cheap, fast, easy to maintain, and packs a decent punch."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:116
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Adder MK4"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:122
msgid ""
"The Adder MK4 is a rare sight these days due to the success its successor, "
"the Adder MK5, which often replaces this model. Its similar hull, however, "
"means careless buyers are sometimes conned into buying mark 4 models "
"disguised as the mark 5."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:135
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Adder MK3"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:140
msgid ""
"The Adder MK3 is one of the first of the Adder line to meet with some "
"success, and many were made before the manufacturer went through its first "
"bankruptcy. Its low price and similarity to subsequent models has led to a "
"resurgence of secondhand sales of the mark 3 model. Compared to the Adder "
"MK4, the mark 3 has weaker shields and hull, but a faster turning rate."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:150
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Adder MK6"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:156
msgid ""
"The Adder MK6 is a small upgrade compared to the highly successful Adder "
"MK5. Since people still prefer the more familiar and reliable mark 5, the "
"mark 6 hasn't seen the same level of success."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:165
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Adder MK7"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:171
msgid ""
"The release of the Adder MK7 sent the manufacturer into a second bankruptcy. "
"Despite stronger shields and longer beam ranges, the popularity of previous "
"models (especially the Adder MK5) prevented them from raising the purchase "
"price enough to recoup the mark 7's development and manufacturing costs."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:180
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Adder MK8"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:186
msgid ""
"After replacing its management, the Adder MK8 returned to the roots of its "
"most popular Adder MK5 model with modernized shields, longer-ranged and "
"stronger beam weapons, and a faster turning rate. The mark 8 targeted "
"practical but nostalgic buyers replacing their mark 5 hardware."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:196
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Adder MK9"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:202
msgid ""
"The Adder MK9 quickly followed the Adder MK8. While still using the popular "
"Adder MK5 as a base, the designers further strengthened its shields, "
"increased the beam weapons' fire rate and thrusters' turning rate, and "
"storage for two nuclear missiles."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:213
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "WX-Lindworm"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:214
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Bomber"
msgstr "Bomber"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:219
msgid ""
"The WX-Lindworm, or \"Worm\" as it's often called, is a bomber-class "
"starfighter. While one of the least-shielded starfighters in active duty, "
"the Worm's two launchers can pack quite a punch. Its goal is to fly in, "
"destroy its target, and fly out or be destroyed."
msgstr ""
"Die WX-Lindworm, oder \"Wurm\" wie sie oft genannt wird, ist ein Bomber-"
"Jäger-hybrid. Zwar handelt es sich um einen der am schwächsten gepanzerten "
"Jäger im aktiven Dienst, dafür sorgen die zwei Raketenschächte für eine "
"ordentliche Feuerkraft. Sein Konzept ist wie folgt: Schneller Anflug, Ziel "
"zerstören, schnelle Flucht - und dabei möglichst nicht selbst zerstört "
"werden."

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:239
msgctxt "playerShip"
msgid "ZX-Lindworm"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:244
msgid ""
"The ZX-Lindworm is a vastly improved version of the WX-Lindworm bomber-class "
"starfighter, with an additional beam weapon, more missiles, tougher hull, "
"faster engine, and more agile thrusters."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:285
msgctxt "playerShip"
msgid "Stingray"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:291
msgid ""
"The Stingray is a little-known predecessor to the MU52 Hornet. Once "
"commonplace, most of the few remaining Stingrays have been converted to "
"couriers and illegal racers due to their (frankly unsafe) impulse engines."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:327
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Fighter"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:333
msgid ""
"Ripostes are weak, nimble interceptors with a single beam weapon that become "
"a greater threat when they engage in larger groups. They're often deployed "
"in reconnaissance, patrol, and outpost-defense roles."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:345
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Strix"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:351
msgid "The Strix is a warp-equipped interceptor built for ambush tactics."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:353
#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:375
msgid ""
"For a starfighter it's slow at sublight flight and lacks manueverability, "
"and most of its shielding is focused forward. However, thanks to its paired "
"beam weapons and ability to strike quickly and escape, they've become a "
"favorite of raiders that seek to catch poorly defended convoys unaware."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:355
msgid ""
"Strixes are often accompanied or complemented by Magpies, which have similar "
"capabilities but use a jump drive for FTL travel."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:367
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Magpie"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:373
msgid "The Magpie is a jump-equipped gunship built for ambush tactics."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:377
msgid ""
"Magpies are often accompanied or complemented by Strixes, which have similar "
"capabilities but use a warp drive for FTL travel."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:389
msgctxt "playerShip"
msgid "Crow"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/starfighters.lua:394
msgid ""
"The Crow gunship is the predecessor to the Magpie starfighter. Slow, weakly "
"armed, and lacking in shields, it's at least relatively agile."
msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The MT52 Hornet is a basic interceptor found in many corners of the "
#~ "galaxy. It's easy to find spare parts for MT52s, not only because they "
#~ "are produced in large numbers, but also because they suffer high losses "
#~ "in combat."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die MT52 Hornet ist ein einfacher Abfangjäger, der in vielen Ecken der "
#~ "Galaxie gefunden werden kann.  Es ist einfach Ersatzteile für MT52er zu "
#~ "finden, nicht nur weil sie in großer Stückzahl produziert werden, sondern "
#~ "auch weil sie im Kampf schnell zerstört werden."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The MU52 Hornet is a new, upgraded version of the MT52. All of its "
#~ "systems are slightly improved over the MT52 model."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die MU52 Hornet ist eine neue, modifizierte Version der MT52. Alle "
#~ "Systeme sind im Vergleich zur MT52 leicht verbessert."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The MP52 Hornet is a significantly upgraded version of MU52 Hornet, with "
#~ "nearly twice the hull strength, nearly three times the shielding, better "
#~ "acceleration, impulse boosters, and a second laser cannon."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die MP52 Hornet ist eine stark erweiterte Version der MU52, mit nahezu "
#~ "doppelter Hüllenstärke, fast dreimal so leistungsfähigen Schilden, "
#~ "besserer Beschleunigung, Impulsbooster und einer zweiten Laserkanone."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Adder line's fifth iteration proved to be a great success among "
#~ "pirates and law officers alike. It is cheap, fast, and easy to maintain, "
#~ "and it packs a decent punch."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die fünfte Generation der Adder-Serie hat sich als hat eine große "
#~ "Erfolgsgeschichte erwiesen und ist sowohl unter Piraten als auch "
#~ "Sicherheitskräften sehr beliebt. Es ist billig, schnell, einfach zu "
#~ "warten, und verfügt über ordentliche Feuerkraft."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The mark 4 Adder is a rare sight these days due to the success its "
#~ "successor, the mark 5 Adder, which often replaces this model. Its similar "
#~ "hull, however, means careless buyers are sometimes conned into buying "
#~ "mark 4 models disguised as the mark 5."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die Adder Mark 4 ist durch den Erfolg ihres Nachfolgers, der Adder MK5, "
#~ "heutzutage nur noch selten anzutreffen und wurde vielfach von dieser "
#~ "ersetzt. die ähnliche Form sorgt allerdings dafür, dass sorglose Käufer "
#~ "manchmal Betrügern zum Opfer fallen, welche eine MK4 tarnen und als MK5 "
#~ "ausgeben."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Adder MK3 is one of the first of the Adder line to meet with some "
#~ "success. A large number of them were made before the manufacturer went "
#~ "through its first bankruptcy. There has been a recent surge of purchases "
#~ "of the Adder MK3 in the secondary market due to its low price and its "
#~ "similarity to subsequent models. Compared to the Adder MK4, the Adder MK3 "
#~ "has weaker shields and hull, but a faster turn speed"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die Adder MK3 ist eine der ersten der Adder-Reihe die einigen Erfolg "
#~ "verbuchen konnten. Eine große Anzahl von ihnen wurde hergestellt bevor "
#~ "der Hersteller seine erste Insolvenz durchgestanden hatte. Kürzlich gab "
#~ "es einen Anstieg an Gebrauchtkäufen der Adder MK3 - aufgrund des "
#~ "niedrigen Preises und der hohen Ähnlichkeit mit späteren Modellen. "
#~ "Verglichen mit der Adder MK4 sind die Schilde und die Hülle der MK3 "
#~ "schwächer, allerdings ist die Wendigkeit höher."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The mark 6 Adder is a small upgrade compared to the highly successful "
#~ "mark 5 model. Since people still prefer the more familiar and reliable "
#~ "mark 5, the mark 6 has not seen the same level of success."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Im Vergleich zur Mark 5 stellt die Adder Mark 6 nur ein kleines Upgrade "
#~ "dar. Da viele Leute immer noch die vertrautere und zuverlässige MK5 "
#~ "bevorzugen, ist die Mark 6 weit weniger erfolgreich."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The release of the Adder Mark 7 sent the manufacturer into a second "
#~ "bankruptcy. They made improvements to the Mark 7 over the Mark 6 like "
#~ "stronger shields and longer beams, but the popularity of their previous "
#~ "models, especially the Mark 5, prevented them from raising the purchase "
#~ "price enough to recoup the development and manufacturing costs of the "
#~ "Mark 7"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Das erscheinen der Adder MK 7 bescherte dem Hersteller die zweite "
#~ "Insolvenz. Gegenüber der MK6 hatte sie stärkere Schilde und eine größere "
#~ "Laserreichweite, aber aufgrund der Beliebtheit der Vorgänger, vor allem "
#~ "der MK5, konnte der Kaufpreis nicht hoch genug angesetzt werden, um die "
#~ "Entwicklungs- und Herstellungskosten der MK7 wieder hereinzubekommen."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "New management after bankruptcy revisited their most popular Adder Mark 5 "
#~ "model with improvements: stronger shields, longer and stronger beams and "
#~ "a faster turn speed. Thus was born the Adder Mark 8 model. Targeted to "
#~ "the practical but nostalgic buyer who must purchase replacements for "
#~ "their Adder Mark 5 fleet"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Nach der Insolvenz nahm das neue Management die Adder MK5 als Vorlage und "
#~ "stattete sie mit stärkeren Schilden, größeren und stärkeren Lasern aus "
#~ "und verbesserte die Wendigkeit: Die Adder MK8 war geboren. Zielgruppe "
#~ "sind pragmatische, aber nostalgische Käufer einen Ersatz für ihre Adder "
#~ "Mk5-Flotte brauchen."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Hot on the heels of the Adder Mark 8 comes the Adder Mark 9. Still using "
#~ "the Adder Mark 5 as a base, the designers provided stronger shields, "
#~ "stronger, longer and faster beams, faster turn speed and for that extra "
#~ "special touch, two nuclear missiles. As their ad says, 'You'll feel "
#~ "better in an Adder Mark 9.'"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Kurz nach der Adder Mark 8 wurde die Adder Mark 9 azf den Markt gebracht. "
#~ "Noch immer wird die Adder Mark 5 als Basis genutzt, aber die Designer "
#~ "versahen sie mit stärkeren Schilde, stärkeren, längeren und schnellere "
#~ "Schilde, sowie einer höheren Wendigkeit - und, als kbesonderes Extra, "
#~ "zwei Nuklearraketen. Wie ihre Werbung sagt: \"In einer Adder Mark 9 "
#~ "fühlen sich einfach besser.\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The ZX-Lindworm is a vastly improved version of the WX-Lindworm. "
#~ "Additional beam weapon, more missiles, tougher, faster and more agile."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Der ZX-Lindworm ist eine stark verbesserte Version der WX-Lindworm. "
#~ "Zusätzliche Laser, mehr Raketen, robuster, schneller und wendiger."
